  bx('pk', '<b>National Voter’s Day:</b> <b>25 January</b>, declared <b>2011</b>, EC foundation day. Conditions: <b>Election Commission (Conditions of Service of Election Commissioners and Transaction of Business) Act, 1991</b>. <b>2018:</b> SC judge salary Rs 2.50 lakh per month = CEC and EC pay. The 61st Am. (1988, in force 1989) lowered voting age, hence two more ECs in Oct 1989.'),
  bx('ye', '<b>Handout conflict:</b> tenure given as 6 years or 65, but a listed gap says Constitution fixes no definitive term. Read: <b>the Constitution itself fixes no term</b>; tenure comes from the 1991 Act.'),
