  bx('pk', '<b>Anoop Baranwal (2023):</b> SC said CEC and ECs be appointed on recommendation of a 3-member committee: <b>PM, Leader of Opposition in Lok Sabha</b> (or leader of largest opposition party), <b>Chief Justice of India</b>; applies until Parliament makes a law under Art 324. Desirable that other ECs be removable on CEC’s grounds (like SC Judge), subject to CEC’s recommendation; service conditions not varied to disadvantage.'),
  bx('ca', '<span class="tag">In the news · Sept 2026 (verify dates)</span><b>Appointment of Election Commissioners:</b> Supreme Court gave a split verdict on whether challenges to the <b>2023 Act</b> on appointment of CEC and ECs should go to a Constitution Bench.'),
